[.tooling/components/apps/mkdocs-platform/docs/speech_interface_design.md#orchestrator-integration]

### Orchestrator Integration

The SearchOrchestrator manages speech synthesis lifecycle:

```javascript
// search-orchestrator.js
class SearchOrchestrator {
  onSpeechStart() {
    this.stateMachine.setSpeechActive(true);
    // Enable interruption listening during speech
    this.voiceRecognition.enableInterruption();
  }

  onSpeechEnd() {
    this.stateMachine.setSpeechActive(false);
    this.stateMachine.transitionTo('passive-listening');
  }

  onSpeechError(error) {
    console.error('Speech synthesis error:', error);
    this.stateMachine.transitionTo('error-recovery');
  }
}
```

